# Denali member cancellation policy

## Approved semantics (DEN-PROD-09)

Composite **D + B + C**:

| Registration state | Member action | Server mode |
| ------------------ | ------------- | ----------- |
| `pending` | Withdraw | `withdraw` — immediate `cancelled`, `cancelSource=member` |
| `waitlisted` | Withdraw | `withdraw` — immediate cancel; no seat was held |
| `approved` + `unpaid` | Self-cancel | `self_cancel` — before `min(paymentDueAt, cancellationDeadlineInstant)` |
| `approved` + `partial` | Request | `request` — creates cancellation request; operator completes via DP-6 |
| `approved` + `paid` | Request | `request` — same as partial |
| Terminal (`cancelled`, `rejected`) | Denied | `denied` |
| After `cancellationDeadlineHours` before `departureAt` | Denied | `denied`, reason `cancellation_cutoff_passed` |

**Cutoff:** `cancellationDeadlineInstant = departureAt − policies.cancellationDeadlineHours` (UTC). When hours omitted, only `paymentDueAt` gates approved-unpaid self-cancel.

**Penalty:** `policies.cancellationPenaltyPercentage` applies at **refund calculation** (DP-6), not at cancel TX.

## Server authority

Eligibility is evaluated **only** on the API (`evaluateDenaliMemberCancellationEligibility`). Portal renders server response; client-side gates are presentation hints only.

## Side effects (approved-unpaid self-cancel / withdraw from approved)

1. Booking `→ cancelled`, `cancelSource=member`
2. Payment hold `voided` when present
3. `paymentDueAt` projection cleared
4. FIFO waitlist promote **one** guest (same as payment-deadline expiry)
5. Outbox `registration.cancelled` payload `source=member`
6. Member notification inbox row (DP-4 / DEN-PROD-12)

## Cancellation request (paid / partial)

1. Persist `member_cancellation_requests` row (status `pending`)
2. Outbox `registration.cancellation_requested`
3. No seat release until operator approves cancel (DP-6)

## Transport

Registration-level cancel only. No per-passenger cancel until DP-5 assignment SoT. Intake snapshot remains audit trail.

## HTTP surfaces

| Method | Path | Actor |
| ------ | ---- | ----- |
| `GET` | `/bookings/:id/member-cancellation` | Member (owner) |
| `POST` | `/bookings/:id/member-cancellation` | Member (owner) |
| Portal BFF | `GET/POST /api/me/registrations/:id/cancellation` | Member session |
